This property is a collection of 2 bedroom furnished apartment with a 4 bedroom penthouse located in East Legon, close to the American house. This full-serviced property is ideal for business  executives on business trips or vacation. The access roads leading to this property makes it convenient for tenants to access all major spots including bars, shopping centers and restaurants in East Legon.  There is 24/7 security surveillance at this property.

