3 Bedroom Furnished Apartment- $3,000

1. The 2 BRs are going for GHC3,500/month, payable in 1 year advance! 
2. The security deposit is GHC7,000, which is 2 month's rent; and 
3. The service and utility charges is GHC450/month, payable in 1 year. It covers water, trash and cleaning and upkeep of common areas.

A 2-bedroom unit at Lakota Court, at Lakeside, is about 125m² and comprise:
a) 1 master bedroom with en-suite bathroom with a water heater, with two built-in wardrobes, a ceiling fan, air
conditioner, DSTV/Digital-TV wired, - [21.3 metres2];
b) 1 bedroom with a built-in wardrobe, a ceiling fan, air conditioner, and DSTV/Digital-TV wired - [13 metres2];
c) 1 living area and dining area with two ceiling fans, air conditioner, DSTV/Digital-TV wired - [56.8 metres2];
d) 1 kitchen with contemporary cabinets and granite countertop - [7.7 metres2];
e) 1 separate toilet and 1 separate bathroom with standing shower and a water heater - [7.5 metres2];
f) A front porch and a rear porch with balustrades - 16.8 metres2] and;
g) 1 storage room with shelves - [2.2 metres2].

The Lease is for a fixed term of one (1) year certain.

